<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cardinal Health raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cardinal Health raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Monday it had raised its rating for Cardinal Health Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Dublin, Ohio, drugs distribution services company closed Friday at 56.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
